Mouse trajectories
------------------

myuri does not generate mouse paths itself. It depends on, and does not
redistribute, the following packages:

  - cursory (Python), https://github.com/Vinyzu/cursory
    © Vinyzu. Dual-licensed under LGPLv3-or-later and GPLv3-or-later.

  - cursory-js (TypeScript), https://github.com/JWriter20/cursory-js
    A port of cursory. © Jake Writer, LGPLv3-or-later.

Both ship cursory's recorded-trajectory database, whose recordings the
original author credits to:

  - Margit Antal, Norbert Fejer and Krisztian Buza, for SapiMouse
    (https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9465583)
  - MIMIC-LOGICS, for Mouse-Synthesizer
    (https://github.com/MIMIC-LOGICS/Mouse-Synthesizer)
